    {
      "source": "A <a href=\"../../../context/reactive/GenericReactiveWebApplicationContext.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.web.context.reactive\"><code>GenericReactiveWebApplicationContext</code></a> that can be used to bootstrap itself\nfrom a contained <a href=\"../../reactive/ReactiveWebServerFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.boot.web.server.reactive\"><code>ReactiveWebServerFactory</code></a> bean.",
      "translation": "一个可以从包含的<a href=\"../../reactive/ReactiveWebServerFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.boot.web.server.reactive\"><code>ReactiveWebServerFactory</code></a>bean 引导自身的<a href=\"../../../context/reactive/GenericReactiveWebApplicationContext.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.web.context.reactive\"><code>GenericReactiveWebApplicationContext</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
